  "sentences": [
    {
      "en": "At school, our teacher gives each group a small job.",
      "zh": "在學校，老師給每個小組一個小任務。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I sit on a chair and move close to the desk.",
      "zh": "我坐在椅子上，移近書桌。"
    },
    {
      "en": "There is a notebook, a pencil, and a ruler before me.",
      "zh": "我面前有筆記本、鉛筆和尺。"
    },
    {
      "en": "We are busy making a little house out of paper.",
      "zh": "我們忙著用紙做一棟小房子。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I write our idea while the other student draws.",
      "zh": "我寫下我們的想法，另一位學生畫圖。"
    },
    {
      "en": "We discuss the size of the house and the door.",
      "zh": "我們討論房子和門的大小。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Then the room is quiet while everyone thinks again.",
      "zh": "接著大家再次思考，教室安靜下來。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Our group finds an answer and shows the teacher.",
      "zh": "我們的小組找出答案，拿給老師看。"
    },
    {
      "en": "She smiles, and we are ready to try our idea.",
      "zh": "她微笑，我們準備試試自己的想法。"
    }
  ],
